== 1. Majorana (RH-charge) realization: even-power obstruction ==
  diagonal insertions n_ii = 4 x_i are EVEN -> diagonal magnitudes
  are integer powers of s^2 = eps_eff: the diagonal-dominated
  spectrum is (eps^2, eps, 1)-spaced, NEVER (eps, sqrt(eps), 1).
  exhaustive unit-coefficient scan (729 textures):
  best max-deviation from the rungs = 0.0727 -> the rung
  spectrum is UNREACHABLE in the Majorana realization.
  (P38 Sec. 3's M_R = diag(1, e^-1/2, e^-1) had M_22 ~ s^1: an
  ODD power on a Majorana diagonal - forbidden by the rule it
  claimed to follow.  The A3 receipt verified a hand-built M.)

