    ratios (0.000000, 0.058097, 1)  entries 3 insertions 3  S = 0.058097  (-68.70 s JUNO-now)
    ratios (0.839323, 0.916146, 1)  entries 3 insertions 4  S = 0.675516  (+301.01 s JUNO-now)
    ratios (0.000000, 0.170150, 1)  entries 4 insertions 4  S = 0.170150  (-1.60 s JUNO-now)
