  -> FULL-RANK NONDEGENERATE members (m1 > 0, all distinct):
     exactly FOUR - S = 0.172747 (rung point, -0.05 s),
     0.167880 (cheap texture, -3.0 s), 0.160500 (-7.4 s, dead),
     0.675516 (~300 s, dead); rank-deficient outcomes (m1 = 0)
     are listed above for completeness and excluded by the
     full-rank requirement.  The two live members differ by
     7.3 sigma at JUNO-final: adjudicable.  MINIMALITY (fewest
     insertions) favors the CHEAP TEXTURE - currently the
     worse-fitting live member.  (An earlier printing of this
     block said TWO-MEMBER and -1.7 sigma: the first missed
     the two data-dead members, the second was the 0.169993
     closed-form transcription error - both corrected.)

== 3. integer RH charges: exhaustive scan, Dirac-consistent ==
  exact rung hits over q in {0..3}^3 x unit +-: 0
  best max-ratio deviation: 0.0144  at q = (3, 2, 3), ratios (0.01634, 0.16617, 1.0)
  METRIC, pinned: max over the two independent ratio deviations
  |m1/m3 - eps_eff| and |m2/m3 - sqrt(eps_eff)|, computed on the
  SEESAW-INVERTED (light) spectrum: the charges sit on M_R and
  the rung target is for the light masses, m_i ~ 1/mu_i with
  mu_i the eigenvalue magnitudes of the scanned texture
  (equivalently: |mu1/mu3 - eps_eff| and |mu1/mu2 - sqrt(e)|).
  WITNESS (so the figure is checkable from one matrix):
  q = (3,2,3), coefficient pattern {11:+1, 12:+1, 13:+1, 22:-1,
  23:+1, 33:0} on magnitudes lam^(q_i+q_j); component deviations
  (0.0144, 0.0092).  Applying the metric to the heavy spectrum
  UNINVERTED gives (0.0144, 0.0770) on this same witness; an
  earlier printing attributed that 0.077 to 'a less complete
  scan variant' - it is the witness's own uninverted second
  component; inversion convention now pinned (caught in review).
  -> integer charges never reach the rungs (scan receipt);
     half-odd charges reach them on the Majorana side (e.g.
     q = (1, 1/2, 0): diag(lam^2, lam, 1) is rule-allowed) but
     die via the Dirac column: charge 1/2 balances no integer
     seam count -> exact zero -> light-mass rank collapse.
     THE OBSTRUCTION IS THE CONJUNCTION, stated as such.

== 4. integer doublet charges, Weinberg operator (direct) ==
  full-rank nondegenerate textures: 30624
  exact rung hits: 0
  best max-ratio deviation (DIRECT metric): 0.0770
  witness: q = (1, 1, 0), coefficients (1, 1, 1, 0, 1, -1),
  ratios (0.0163, 0.0984, 1)
  -> integer doublet charges never reach the rungs either; and
     the rung DIAGONAL diag(lam^2, lam, 1) forces 2q1 = 2,
     2q2 = 1, q3 = 0 (common shift fixed by q3 = 0; a shift
     rescales the spectrum, not the ratios): q_L = (1, 1/2, 0)
     is the UNIQUE normalized assignment realizing it.  The
     surviving realization is SELECTED, not chosen.
